# Added by the mutation audit of 2026-10-31: a used entity whose prov:value
# is the EMPTY literal.  `(entity, PROV.value, None) in graph` keeps it, so
# two entities survive the filter and the region's assert fails; a
# truthiness filter (`bool(m{ }.first())`) would drop it and return a dict.
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .

ex:artifact prov:wasGeneratedBy ex:transformation .
ex:transformation prov:used ex:config, ex:emptyConfig .
ex:config prov:value "{\"scale\": 2}" .
ex:emptyConfig prov:value "" .
